options:
    prefix: <#c3a6ff>&lCRATE <#888888>» <#cfc3e6>

on right click on ender chest:
    player is holding tripwire hook
    cancel event
    remove 1 of tripwire hook from player's inventory
    give 5 of diamond to player
    send "{@prefix}Opened Mythic Crate! Won <#a6ffcb>5x Diamonds<#cfc3e6>!" to player
    play sound "ui.toast.challenge_complete" with volume 1 and pitch 1.4 at player
